# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Next.js and the registry scripts read it; .env.local is gitignored.

# The site's origin with no trailing slash, such as https://kosmosui.com. Metadata, the sitemap, robots.txt,
# llms.txt, the .md pages and every install command (the registry URL) are built from it.
# On Vercel it falls back to the production URL; elsewhere, unset, everything publishes localhost.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=
